    <string name="settings_detailed_title">inkcazo-enkcazo</string>
    <string name="settings_detailed_body">idibine izinzimu kunye nexesha lokudlala. i-android iyakuxoxa izinzimu plug events kuisicelo esisebenzayo kuphela, ke le imiyalelo ibusisa isaziso esijulile. i-bluetooth ilandelwe nayiphi na indlela.</string>
    <string name="settings_detailed_unavailable">ayifumanekiyo kuze kube kuthunyelwe i-bluetooth: le building itsho nje iconnectedDevice service type, yo andoido 14+ ibophele ibluetooth permission.</string>
    <string name="settings_playback_only_title">ubala ixesha lokudlala kuphela</string>
    <string name="settings_playback_only_body">isitayistiki sibala ixesha lokudlala ngokwenene kunokuba ixhume. iisession eziqaliwe kunye nokufikelela inkcazo kugqithisele kulinganiswa; abaye bakuba ekunene balahla.</string>
